...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, this one is incorrect -- that girl overslept because\nshe couldn't sleep at night, so that eliminates answer\none.\d%K%P
「啊，这里不对。\n这个孩子睡不着是因为睡了懒觉，\n从这个时间来看应该最先排除的吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh... I see.\d%K%P
「啊…是啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, it's a trick question, basically. In other words,\nthe correct answer is four: 'You better not think you'll\nbe able to gloss this over by merely laughing it off.\d%K%P
「嘛，被这个选项骗了呢。这个正确的应该是第四个\n『以为用笑来敷衍会得到完全的宽恕，就大错特错了』…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh? But the answer sheet's saying the correct answer is\nthree.\d%K%P
「咦？可参考答案是第三个啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHey, I told you not to look at that. This was another\ntrick answer.\d%K%P
「喂，提前看答案可不行。\n刚刚我也是被骗了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat kind of messed up teaching method is this?\d%K%P
「这是什么奇怪的教法啊」%K%P
After the end of our heart-warming (?) dinner, and about\nan hour before heading out to the public bath, we\ndedicated some time to cramming for Mitoko's end-term\nexams.%K%P
温暖人心的（？）吃饭时间没有拖延就结束了，\n距离去洗澡的时间还有一个小时。\n这是为了应付下周期末考试而举办的学习会。%K%P
Well, not like Mitoko, being the way she was, would skip\nout on schoolwork even without me around.%K%P
美都子本来就是被公认非常认真的一个孩子，\n而且一点都不会通融，\n因此绝对不会缺少这样的努力。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAll right. That's it for Japanese. Next we should take\ncare of Ma-- English!\d%K%P
「好的，国语就算过了。\n之后是…英语吧就英语了！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Yeah.\d%K%P
「…说的也是啊」%K%P
Still, I figured I could put some of my ancient knowledge\nto use and boost her grades, if only by a little.%K%P
而我，也重操起就业，\n为提高她的成绩而努力着。%K%P
It took us three full days just to get used to the\ntemporary reversal of our social ranks, though. As in, me\nhaving authority over her.%K%P
但是即便这样，以前果然还是以前。\n开始教她的头３天里，只是为了建立\n家庭教师和学生的关系就费尽了心思。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, Mitoko.\d%K%P
「呐，美都子」%K%P
