「差不多也该决定要升学到哪里了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's still too early to think about that!\d%K%P
「还早着呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOkay, let me rephrase that. Have you decided if you want\nto continue your education?\d%K%P
「那，换个问题。\n差不多也要决定升学的事情了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...It's still too early to think about that.\d%K%P
「…还早着呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I had yet to have a serious talk with Mitoko's homeroom\nteacher ever since losing my chance during that parent-\nteacher conference in May.%K%P
５月的“那个”监护人座谈会之后，\n关于美都子将来的去向，\n我也没怎么和她的“班主任”继续商量。%K%P
Under normal circumstances, I should have done that right\naway.%K%P
按理说，考虑到美都子家里的事情，\n她应该是我不得不密切联系的对象。%K%P
I should do it right away, but...%K%P
…只不过对象问题嘛…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, Mitoko.\d%K%P
「我说啊，美都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHm? What?\d%K%P
「嗯～，怎么了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIsn't it about time you started thinking about quitting\nyour delivery job?\d%K%P
「也差不多是时候放弃送报纸了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSummer break's almost here, and it'll probably end up\nbeing the most important one in your life. I think summer\ncram schools are already accepting signups.\d%K%P
「马上就到暑假了，这个假期是胜负的关键，\n夏季课程的补习班什么的，差不多也要开始报名了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Um, Mr. Laid-off.\d%K%P
「…那个啊，失业先生」%K%P
