「现在，我正在专心学习所以别和我说话」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「…抱歉」%K%P
She seemed pretty responsive right up until now, though.%K%P
明明直到刚刚，都在好好地附和我的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm... Look, I'm glad you're worried about me and all, but\nI'm going to be fine, okay?\d%K%P
「那个…多谢关心我的事情啦，\n不过我没问题啦」%K%P
I thought you were trying to concentrate.%K%P
明明刚刚才说了不要搭话的吧。%K%P
I suppose this issue was something she herself understood\nhad to be discussed one day, regardless of how much she\ndidn't want to.%K%P
对美都子来说，这个话题\n虽然不想接触，但是也不能避开吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMy grades are still up there with the better students. I\nmean, you've seen my midterms, right?\d%K%P
