%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah.\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
After becoming a third year student, Mitoko was ranked\n47th in her school according to her midterm exam results,\nwhich was definitely something to be proud of.%K%P
第三年首次期中考试，\n美都子拿到了在学校排名第４７的好成绩。%K%P
However, I was not entirely sure if that was really\nsomething to celebrate, as I knew she'd dropped down from\n8th since her second year end-term exams.%K%P
然而对于在第二年期末考试中排名第８的她来说，\n那个实在算不上什么好成绩。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd I like working. I'd be okay with just finding a job\nafter graduation.\d%K%P
「而且，很早以前就喜欢工作了。\n毕业了的话，完全不介意就这样工作」%K%P
Her mother. The boarding house.%K%P
母亲的事情、公寓的事情。%K%P
...And probably even me.%K%P
…以及，多半，还有我的事情。%K%P
All those things were weighing down on Mitoko, robbing her\nof her time to study.%K%P
这前半个学期，有着太多的事情，\n当然没法安心学习。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou don't like studying?\d%K%P
「你不喜欢学习么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d.........No?\d%K%P
「………也不是」%K%P
So her eyes sparkling every time I taught her something\nnew was just my imagination, then?%K%P
明明每次听到不了解的知识，眼睛都会放光的。%K%P
Why would she never leave me alone until I managed to\nexplain something in a way she could understand?%K%P
明明有不明白的问题，不到弄懂就不会离开。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dListen, Mitoko.\d%K%P
「那个啊，美都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
She wasn't a stranger to childish tantrums, and over time,\nI'd seen her show many faces befitting her age. But on\nthis issue alone, she acted like a perfect adult...%K%P
虽然有的时候举止言行显得很孩子气，\n不过现在她的表现真的可以用“无奈的成人”来形容…%K%P
It... frustrated me.%K%P
真让人有点不能释怀啊。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf I find a proper job, I'd like you to consider\ncontinuing your education.\d%K%P
