「不，那个，虽然不知道什么时候才能找到。\n但我会尽量快点的」%K%P
It had already been a month since I lost my job after\nworking for a mere two weeks.%K%P
我在短短两周内就丢失了本应到手的工作，\n然后又过了一个月。%K%P
Since then, I'd been spending my mornings job hunting, my\nafternoons working my part-time job, and my nights\ntutoring Mitoko.%K%P
这段时间，我早上去找工作，下午打工，\n夜晚就当美都子的家教，\n重复着极具规律的生活。%K%P
My current record was... zero wins and twelve defeats.%K%P
现在的结果是…０胜１２负。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou don't need to hurry this kinda thing. We should find\na job that's perfect for you, okay?\d%K%P
「不用为那种事情着急啦。\n慢慢找个和你相称的工作吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf I don't pull myself together, you'll be graduating\nbefore I know it.\d%K%P
「如果还这么悠闲准备的话，\n一转眼就会到毕业典礼的哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd as your self-professed guardian, I would also be\nproud if you managed to get into a good school. It's just\nas much my wish as yours.\d%K%P
「而且，作为美都子的监护人，\n如果你进入了好学校我也会骄傲的。\n因此，这也算是我的请求」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut I really don't think I can put all that strain on\nyou.\d%K%P
