I had two job interviews tomorrow -- one with a small\nsoftware developer, another with a medium-sized sales\ncompany.%K%P
明天，有两个公司的面试。\n一个是只有几个员工的小软件公司，\n另一个是中型贸易公司。%K%P
My experience and knowledge would probably be of more use\nwith the latter, but I probably had a better chance with\nthe former. I wouldn't fail this time...%K%P
后者能很好地运用我的经验和知识，\n但是合格率高的则是前者。\n这次可一定…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd... I mean, you've got your own life to consider. You\ncan't look after me for... I mean, you're not planning on\nstaying here forever, right?\d%K%P
「还有啊…也有失业先生的缘故。\n不管什么时候我都…不，这里都需要我」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll stay until Ms. Honoka comes back.\d%K%P
「直到穗香小姐回来」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
After all, I now had something more important to hold onto\nthan my own petty aspirations.%K%P
然而现在，有比自己的志向还重要的事情。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
