%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe will. I'm sure of it.\d%K%P
「会回来的。绝对会」%K%P
Or rather, looking after Mitoko was the primary thing that\ndrove me right now.%K%P
不如说，保护美都子，\n才是现在我的心愿。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn case she somehow happens to be a little late, well...\nI'll stay with you until you find yourself a husband, at\nleast.\d%K%P
「要是穗香小姐回来有点迟了的话…\n对了，直到美都子嫁出去之前，我都会在这里」%K%P
