%LC美都子
\dThat sounds like something a father would say.\d%K%P
「总觉得刚刚那番话像是父亲说的呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I'm your guardian. There's a slight issue with our\nages for you to view me as a father, but I'd be glad if\nyou thought of me as someone close to you.\d%K%P
「因为我是监护人啊。\n虽然被认为是父亲会有年龄上的羞耻，\n不过被认为是与其相近的存在我会很高兴的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Mitoko drew closer to me. I could see the reflection of my\nface in her pupils.%K%P
不知什么时候，我正面的脸在美都子眼中，\n变成了特写。%K%P
We continued gazing into each other's eyes; she had\nfeatures reminiscent of Ms. Honoka's, though perhaps a tad\nbit more defined.%K%P
虽然她的外表很像穗香小姐，\n不过现在她在我面前以更加清晰的面容，\n在非常近的距离和方向上注视着我。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What do you think? Would you be okay with that?\d%K%P
「即、即便如此，也不能做约定么？」%K%P
I struggled to keep my back straight as I felt myself\ngetting drawn into her deep, brown eyes.%K%P
虽然都像是快要被吸收了，但我还在努力地虚张声势，\n问着美都子…%K%P
