%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Huh?\d%K%P
「…哈？」%K%P
%LCAdvertiser
%LC报导
\dRelease date: October 26, 2007. Release date: November\n30, 2007. Release date: December 21, 2007.\d%K%P
「预定于２００７年１０月２６日发售…\n预定于２００７年１１月３０日发售…\n预定于２００７年１２月２１日发售…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, what is that person doing over there...?\d%K%P
「那个，话说刚刚那位是…？」%K%P
%LCDirector
%LC理事
\dAh, he used to be our PR person, but now we're having him\nprepare the scripts for voice recordings.\d%K%P
「啊啊，他原来是做宣传的，\n现在正准备制作录制语音的脚本呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm? I-I see... Seems pretty complicated.\d%K%P
「？哈、哈啊，真是辛苦啊」%K%P
%LCDirector
%LC理事
\dAhaha, it's nothing compared to your job.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈～和你一比的话」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Huh?\d%K%P
「…哈？」%K%P
%LCDirector
%LC理事
\dAnyway, let's get started. You know how to use Ph*t*sh*p,\nright?\d%K%P
