%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, not really...?\d%K%P
「呀，那是什么？」%K%P
%LCDirector
%LC理事
\dWell, you'll get used to it soon enough. Anyway, could\nyou have a look at that storyboard panel?\d%K%P
「马上就会习惯了。\n那么，这里有铅笔字对吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHmm, location: classroom; time: evening. The female\nteacher (Keiko) is sitting on the protagonist's (Ryouichi)\ndesk. Her feet, covered by black stockings, are pressed\nagainst the protagonist's face.\d%K%P
「什么什么…地点是学校的教室。时间是傍晚。\n女教师·惠子坐在主人公·辽一的桌子上，伸出脚，\n被黑丝包裹的的脚压在辽一脸上…？」%K%P
%LCAdvertiser
%LC报导
\dRelease date: January 25, 2008. Release date: February\n29, 2008. Release date: March 28, 2008.\d%K%P
「预定于２００８年１月２５日发售…\n预定于２００８年２月２９日发售…\n预定于２００８年３月２８日发售…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dKeiko has a sensual expression on her face. Her right\nhand is inside her skirt. Her left hand is on the desk,\nsupporting her weight. It is up to you whether to render\nthis as a front shot or an angle shot...?\d%K%P
「惠子，露出诱惑的表情。右手则伸向裙中。\n左手支撑着坐在桌子上的身体。大概从正面构图的，\n也在原画方面讨论下是不是应该从斜前方………？」%K%P
%LCDirector
%LC理事
\dOh, I see... It's one of those 'discretionary' ones. Just\ntry doing a rough sketch of both versions, then we'll come\nback to it.\d%K%P
「啊，对了…这里有２张图。\n先把这两边都粗略地看一下，然后再说」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, wait a minute... What exactly is my job?\d%K%P
「啊，那之前我要做什么…？」%K%P
%LCDirector
%LC理事
\dIllustrator, what else?\d%K%P
「原画啊原画」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Pardon?\d%K%P
「…哈？」%K%P
%LCPresident
%LC经理
