I was drenched in sweat, with my pajamas sticking to my\nbody, and there was the sensation of something soft at my\npalms.%K%P
出了一身的臭汗。\n皮肤粘在睡衣上感觉很不舒服。\n手上也有一种奇怪的柔软的触感。%K%P
