\dHmmm...\d%K%P
她真的是泽嶋的女儿么？%K%P
Lately, I'd been finding myself more and more confused by\nthis girl.%K%P
不，虽然这个是真的，\n但是真的是世间所知的『泽嶋』那个人么？%K%P
Was she really the daughter of -that- Sawashima?%K%P
对美都子的亲切，\n怎么看都是发自内心的好意，\n佐佐木先生也是，经常不可思议地扮演着好人。%K%P
Well, I guess she wouldn't be lying on that point, but I\ngrew more and more suspicious of the \dSawashima\d image she\nwas trying to uphold.%K%P
而且眼神…%K%P
No matter how you looked at it, her kindness to Mitoko\nseemed genuine, and this Sasaki person came off as a\npretty nice guy sometimes.%K%P
如果稍微放松警惕的话，马上就没了严肃，\n变成了柔和的表情。%K%P
Besides, her eyes...%K%P
好奇怪，怎么想都觉得好奇怪…%K%P
The moment she thought you weren't looking at her, they'd\nlose their sharpness, turning round and sort of... gentle-\nlooking.%K%P
